  - ORIGINAL-w08::vm1201-prop-jcm628-toplayer
  - ORIGINAL-w08::vm1201-prop-jcm629-toplayer
  description: Review complete exact successor bytes and actual source scope independently,
    then bind approved final selection through native plan and final checks.
  ownership_note: Root controls reviewer assignment and any later source application.
  acceptance_checks:
  - Complete previous histories/source origin objects are exact.
  - No new identity, constituent, alias or role claim outside the filed correction.
  - Native predicates, final corpus dependencies and release gates pass without waiver.
limitations:
- Private author self-review only; the original independent finding remains open pending
  distinct complete-successor review.
- No maintained source, aggregate, canonical SSSOM, unified snapshot, code, workflow,
  test or Git/GitHub mutation.
- Per-owner native projection is diagnostic, not full KG B4 or release verification.
- Three preliminary author-script checks refused before candidate publication; exact
  scripts/results are preserved, with no changed gate or schema.
- Existing source-case uncertainty and source/role/export holds remain exact.
